cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the exact OGARD release and source revision used."
title: "OGARD: Open Grid Asset Reliability Data Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bektas
    given-names: Deniz
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
url: "https://denbek.github.io/ogard/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DenBek/ogard"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Executable reference implementation of OGARD, a method for reconciling
  electricity-network equipment records (maintenance work orders, installation
  history and telemetry associations) while preserving source evidence, time
  validity and review decisions. Includes five synthetic power-transformer
  scenarios, two input layouts, a baseline comparison and one-command validation.
  The release also includes the four OGARD technical papers (version 0.1.2),
  architecture diagrams, reference files and a synthetic worked example.
keywords:
  - electricity grid
  - asset data
  - record linkage
  - data engineering
  - power transformers
  - provenance
